OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FClear spells
OL,6,Fand occasionally heavy showers
OL,7,Fcontinue through the evening and
OL,8,Fovernight, especially in north and
OL,9,Fwest. Chilly, risk of a touch of grass
OL,10,Ffrost especially in sheltered eastern
OL,11,Fparts.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FAnother day of sunny spells
OL,14,Fand occasionally heavy showers, wintry
OL,15,Fover mountains, the showers easing a
OL,16,Flittle through the afternoon and
OL,17,Fevening. Occasionally fresh
OL,18,Fsouthwesterly then northwesterly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
