OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDry,
OL,6,Fbright for much of Thursday then
OL,7,Fcloudier with occasionally heavy rain
OL,8,Flater. Rain clears overnight to leave
OL,9,FFriday and Saturday with sunny spells
OL,10,Fand frequent heavy, blustery showers.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
